cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TEAM, please cite it as below."
title: "TEAM: Transport Equity and Access Model"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Travel times from every populated part of Auckland to everyday services and
  jobs by walking, low-stress cycling and public transport; the people beyond
  stated access standards by deprivation, car ownership and age; and screening
  reasons that point to the kind of change that would bring each place within
  reach.
